                "type": "TextualBody",
                "value": "Hinge of the lower flap at approximately 62.6% of the expanded image height. Located by the notch the crease cuts in the card's right edge in the expanded photograph, and confirmed by the collapsed card's lower edge coinciding with the same row. Everything below this line is the flap.",
