              "label": { "en": ["Flap free edge when folded"] },
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "value": "Approximately 25.2% of the expanded image height. This is where the flap's free edge lands when it is folded up through 180 degrees, derived as the crease position minus the flap length (37.4%). It is not a fold in the paper.",
